From 27c8376279de0519f19388a94cde2f22260d3d9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: downstream <downstream@local>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:42:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Muse provider: cloaking, reasoning recovery and pricing

Consolidated from the following original patches (file custody by final owner):

- original #61: Cloak Muse Code tools and register Wonder
- original #67: Retry Muse without foreign reasoning state
- original #69: Retry Muse without expired reasoning references
- original #70: Price Muse Wonder usage instead of silently zero
